{"id":207,"doub_id":207,"title":"这个杀手不太冷","years":"1994","class":"动作","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2913554676.webp","doub_score":9.4,"IMDB_number":"","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"","bianji":"[]","performer":"","language":"","release":"","alias":"","abstract":"里昂（让·雷诺饰）是名孤独的职业杀手，受人雇佣。一天，邻居家小姑娘马蒂尔达（纳塔丽·波特曼饰)敲开他的房门，要求在他那里暂避杀身之祸。原来邻居家的主人是警方缉毒组的眼线，只因贪污了一小包毒品而遭恶警（加里·奥德曼饰）杀害全家的惩罚。马蒂尔达得到里昂的留救，幸免于难，并留在里昂那里。里昂教小女孩使枪，她教里昂法文，两人关系日趋亲密，相处融洽。","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581177788.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511077583.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511068675.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p470981086.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511077965.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511118051.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2408302602.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p974544416.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p630017633.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ZDqrT6sHnk8219sku2quSg?pwd=tuqt\",\"size\":\"2.29\",\"date\":\"2025-09-01\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 法国 / 美国","orginName":"《这个杀手不太冷 Léon》","ratingbetterthan":"","tag":""}